sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Pod as Pod spec
    participant Kb as Kubelet
    participant CPU as CPU manager
    participant Topo as Topology manager
    participant Dev as Device manager
    Pod->>Kb: requests == limits, integer CPUs
    Kb->>Kb: that makes it Guaranteed QoS
    Kb->>CPU: allocate exclusive cores
    Kb->>Dev: allocate the GPU
    Dev-->>Topo: which NUMA node is that GPU on?
    CPU-->>Topo: which NUMA node are those cores on?
    Topo->>Topo: can both come from one NUMA node?
    alt aligned
        Topo-->>Kb: admit — CPU, memory and GPU share a node
    else cannot align
        Topo-->>Kb: reject under single-numa policy
        Note over Topo,Kb: better to fail admission than to run at half the memory bandwidth
    end
